1
00:00:12,530 --> 00:00:20,580
♪From primal chaos to the starry sky♪

2
00:00:20,580 --> 00:00:28,340
♪In the whole world,
we shall hold the balance♪

3
00:00:44,920 --> 00:00:46,940
♪The cauldron tempers divine blades♪

4
00:00:46,940 --> 00:00:50,810
♪The furnace refines the empty void♪

5
00:00:52,820 --> 00:00:54,930
♪The Way is in mystic fate♪

6
00:00:54,930 --> 00:00:58,720
♪Be brave enough
to split the primal chaos wide open♪

7
00:01:36,380 --> 00:01:37,620
[Pull Strings]

8
00:01:37,620 --> 00:01:39,380
[Adapted from the novel
by Yan Gui Zheng Zhuan]

9
00:01:40,000 --> 00:01:42,770
We must pull up the stake in our hearts.

10
00:01:43,070 --> 00:01:43,980
Believe in ourselves.

11
00:01:45,480 --> 00:01:47,740
Believe we can defeat the Sea Demon.

12
00:01:47,950 --> 00:01:49,180
Clap if you're with me.

13
00:01:53,200 --> 00:01:53,850
Yes!

14
00:01:53,870 --> 00:01:55,410
Turning such a moving story

15
00:01:55,430 --> 00:01:56,740
into something so uplifting.

16
00:01:56,760 --> 00:01:58,540
That's why I chose Hua Ritian

17
00:01:58,560 --> 00:02:00,290
to be the Grandlord.

18
00:02:00,310 --> 00:02:01,660
Tell it again, Grandlord.

19
00:02:59,430 --> 00:03:02,660
The Sea Demon is here!

20
00:03:03,520 --> 00:03:04,850
The Sea Demon is here.

21
00:03:06,080 --> 00:03:07,450
Run. Run.

22
00:03:08,680 --> 00:03:09,450
Where are they?

23
00:03:13,680 --> 00:03:14,730
The Sea Demon is here.

24
00:03:14,750 --> 00:03:16,450
The Sea Demon is here. Run.

25
00:03:16,630 --> 00:03:17,290
Run.

26
00:03:19,710 --> 00:03:20,730
What's going on?

27
00:03:21,630 --> 00:03:22,450
The Sea Demon is here.

28
00:03:22,470 --> 00:03:23,500
The Sea Demon is here.

29
00:03:24,000 --> 00:03:24,570
Wait.

30
00:03:24,590 --> 00:03:25,540
Wait.

31
00:03:25,560 --> 00:03:27,260
Have you seen Hua Ritian,
Qing Luan, and Bai Shi?

32
00:03:27,280 --> 00:03:28,540
The Sea Demon is here.

33
00:03:28,560 --> 00:03:29,780
Xiong Er, take him away.

34
00:03:29,800 --> 00:03:30,290
Okay.

35
00:03:31,710 --> 00:03:32,220
The Sea Demon.

36
00:03:32,240 --> 00:03:32,850
The Sea Demon.

37
00:03:34,000 --> 00:03:34,780
What Sea Demon?

38
00:03:44,560 --> 00:03:45,500
How much longer?

39
00:03:45,840 --> 00:03:46,890
Is it ready yet?

40
00:03:46,910 --> 00:03:48,130
Soon. Almost done.

41
00:04:07,750 --> 00:04:08,940
It really is the Sea Demon.

42
00:04:08,960 --> 00:04:09,730
Don't eat me.

43
00:04:09,870 --> 00:04:10,540
Eat him.

44
00:04:10,560 --> 00:04:11,220
He's bulky.

45
00:04:11,240 --> 00:04:11,730
Eat him.

46
00:04:11,870 --> 00:04:14,010
- Don't. I'm scared too.
- I'm not afraid.

47
00:04:14,030 --> 00:04:15,260
Don't eat my brother.

48
00:04:23,950 --> 00:04:24,730
Everyone.

49
00:04:24,750 --> 00:04:26,540
Don't forget
what the Grandlord taught you.

50
00:04:26,560 --> 00:04:27,340
Fight back.

51
00:04:27,870 --> 00:04:28,660
Fight back.

52
00:04:28,680 --> 00:04:29,220
Fight it.

53
00:04:29,240 --> 00:04:29,930
Fight back.

54
00:04:45,600 --> 00:04:46,370
The shooting stars?

55
00:04:54,240 --> 00:04:54,700
Don't.

56
00:04:54,870 --> 00:04:56,140
Stop watching the shooting stars.

57
00:04:56,160 --> 00:04:56,900
Think about me.

58
00:04:57,000 --> 00:04:58,140
My hand's cramping up.

59
00:05:29,870 --> 00:05:30,370
It's gone?

60
00:05:30,600 --> 00:05:31,580
Looks like it worked.

61
00:05:31,920 --> 00:05:33,340
We defeated the Sea Demon.

62
00:05:33,480 --> 00:05:35,340
We truly defeated it.

63
00:05:35,720 --> 00:05:36,960
We defeated the Sea Demon.

64
00:05:42,260 --> 00:05:43,520
Great.

65
00:05:43,800 --> 00:05:45,160
Great.

66
00:05:47,180 --> 00:05:50,100
[Episode 13]

67
00:05:51,240 --> 00:05:52,100
You mean...

68
00:05:52,750 --> 00:05:54,140
You lost to the Sea Deity Sect.

69
00:05:54,160 --> 00:05:56,930
Must be the formation on Bear Island.

70
00:05:56,950 --> 00:05:58,140
It's been too long.

71
00:05:58,270 --> 00:05:59,370
It fell into disrepair.

72
00:05:59,430 --> 00:06:02,140
So you mean the formation I left

73
00:06:02,870 --> 00:06:03,730
stopped working?

74
00:06:03,750 --> 00:06:05,370
No, no.

75
00:06:05,750 --> 00:06:08,930
My humble magical power is insufficient.

76
00:06:08,950 --> 00:06:10,730
I couldn't use your formation properly.

77
00:06:13,920 --> 00:06:15,170
On Bear Island,

78
00:06:16,720 --> 00:06:18,220
did you see any outsiders?

79
00:06:18,240 --> 00:06:18,980
Outsiders?

80
00:06:21,430 --> 00:06:22,700
Yes, I did.

81
00:06:22,750 --> 00:06:24,340
Must be those outsiders

82
00:06:24,750 --> 00:06:26,170
messing up Bear Island.

83
00:06:31,160 --> 00:06:32,170
Seems like this time,

84
00:06:32,170 --> 00:06:33,750
[Bian Zhuang, Lord of Horizon Hall]

85
00:06:33,750 --> 00:06:35,340
I must step in myself.

86
00:06:39,160 --> 00:06:42,540
Bear Island
Elementary Calisthenics, Routine No. 3:

87
00:06:42,560 --> 00:06:43,930
Colorful Sunshine.

88
00:06:44,240 --> 00:06:45,930
Now begins.

89
00:06:46,360 --> 00:06:48,370
One, two, three, four.

90
00:06:48,510 --> 00:06:50,340
Two, two, three, four.

91
00:06:50,340 --> 00:06:52,460
♪Now, a levee holds back the storm♪

92
00:06:52,810 --> 00:06:55,910
♪Fight against fate for my life♪

93
00:06:55,910 --> 00:06:58,720
♪Close eyes to sense the world♪

94
00:06:58,720 --> 00:07:01,280
♪Years splash ink♪

95
00:07:01,280 --> 00:07:03,490
♪Trekking far and wide♪

96
00:07:03,490 --> 00:07:06,650
♪Silent in subtleties♪

97
00:07:06,650 --> 00:07:09,450
♪The task descends on me♪

98
00:07:11,480 --> 00:07:12,900
Oh no, we overslept.

99
00:07:13,190 --> 00:07:13,980
Brother, this is all your fault.

100
00:07:14,000 --> 00:07:14,580
Your fault.

101
00:07:14,600 --> 00:07:15,460
We were up so late last night.

102
00:07:15,720 --> 00:07:17,530
- It's your fault, we're late.
- Five, six, seven, eight.

103
00:07:17,680 --> 00:07:18,460
Run fast.

104
00:07:18,460 --> 00:07:20,460
Three, two, three, four.

105
00:07:21,040 --> 00:07:23,280
- Five, six, seven, eight.
- Who is it?

106
00:07:24,270 --> 00:07:29,170
Four, two, three, four...

107
00:07:38,480 --> 00:07:39,730
After last night's battle,

108
00:07:39,870 --> 00:07:41,930
the villagers must believe
in Sea Deity Sect now.

109
00:07:41,950 --> 00:07:43,900
Why hasn't Xiong Laosan come find us?

110
00:07:51,160 --> 00:07:51,930
Here.

111
00:07:52,430 --> 00:07:53,220
What's this?

112
00:07:53,680 --> 00:07:55,140
This is an amulet.

113
00:07:55,160 --> 00:07:56,100
An amulet?

114
00:07:57,870 --> 00:07:59,410
Is it a talisman?

115
00:07:59,430 --> 00:08:00,540
Does it have magical power?

116
00:08:00,630 --> 00:08:02,730
Or is the material special?

117
00:08:02,750 --> 00:08:03,660
None of those.

118
00:08:03,920 --> 00:08:05,050
In the Mortal Realm,

119
00:08:05,240 --> 00:08:07,700
there's one magic that never dies.

120
00:08:07,750 --> 00:08:09,780
It's called sincerity.

121
00:08:09,870 --> 00:08:11,780
It's not made of fancy materials,

122
00:08:12,040 --> 00:08:13,780
and it doesn't perform miracles,

123
00:08:13,920 --> 00:08:16,250
but it's full of real heart.

124
00:08:16,950 --> 00:08:18,340
Now that we both have it,

125
00:08:18,480 --> 00:08:20,170
I'd say our hearts are in sync.

126
00:08:21,920 --> 00:08:23,340
In sync?

127
00:08:29,160 --> 00:08:29,980
Yunxiao.

128
00:08:31,310 --> 00:08:32,890
No matter how the plan unfolds,

129
00:08:33,320 --> 00:08:35,060
I hope you will remember one thing.

130
00:08:36,510 --> 00:08:37,370
Whether it's deception,

131
00:08:37,750 --> 00:08:38,730
or concealment,

132
00:08:40,360 --> 00:08:41,220
sometimes,

133
00:08:41,630 --> 00:08:43,060
it's not always out of malice.

134
00:08:47,360 --> 00:08:48,130
I don't get it.

135
00:08:49,240 --> 00:08:50,340
That's fine.

136
00:08:50,870 --> 00:08:52,130
Someday you will.

137
00:08:54,550 --> 00:08:55,890
If my calculations are correct,

138
00:08:56,120 --> 00:08:57,530
it should arrive today.

139
00:08:57,910 --> 00:08:58,940
What should arrive?

140
00:09:01,360 --> 00:09:02,530
The real Sea Demon.

141
00:09:05,840 --> 00:09:06,420
Dad.

142
00:09:06,910 --> 00:09:08,530
We've already joined the Sea Deity Sect.

143
00:09:08,550 --> 00:09:09,730
Why don't you join too?

144
00:09:09,960 --> 00:09:11,300
As long as we beat the Sea Demon,

145
00:09:11,360 --> 00:09:12,700
who we follow doesn't matter.

146
00:09:12,750 --> 00:09:14,060
You are still young.

147
00:09:14,960 --> 00:09:16,100
You haven't seen much.

148
00:09:16,360 --> 00:09:17,770
If you truly see it,

149
00:09:17,960 --> 00:09:19,730
it will be too late.

150
00:09:24,870 --> 00:09:25,850
See that?

151
00:09:27,550 --> 00:09:29,340
It's already begun.

152
00:09:35,880 --> 00:09:37,050
What is that thing?

153
00:09:41,440 --> 00:09:42,580
Three, four...

154
00:09:57,880 --> 00:09:59,180
A bunch of mortals.

155
00:09:59,840 --> 00:10:01,130
How dare you talk big?

156
00:10:01,150 --> 00:10:02,650
Claiming to defeat the Sea Demon.

157
00:10:04,750 --> 00:10:05,940
Who are you?

158
00:10:06,360 --> 00:10:07,730
No more tricks.

159
00:10:07,750 --> 00:10:08,730
Come down, now.

160
00:10:08,840 --> 00:10:10,420
Come down.

161
00:10:10,550 --> 00:10:11,650
No way.

162
00:10:11,790 --> 00:10:12,770
Come down.

163
00:10:12,840 --> 00:10:15,220
Word is Bear Island
got a Sea Deity Sect,

164
00:10:15,240 --> 00:10:17,100
challenging my Westdawn Sect.

165
00:10:18,750 --> 00:10:20,370
Who among you worships it?

166
00:10:20,670 --> 00:10:22,770
We all do.

167
00:10:22,960 --> 00:10:25,490
We defeated the Sea Demon last night.

168
00:10:28,840 --> 00:10:30,010
Defeat the Sea Demon?

169
00:10:30,320 --> 00:10:31,180
As if you could.

170
00:10:31,360 --> 00:10:33,100
Don't you insult the Sea Deity Sect.

171
00:10:33,240 --> 00:10:34,890
Let's go grab rocks

172
00:10:34,910 --> 00:10:35,820
and knock him down.

173
00:10:35,840 --> 00:10:38,340
Get him.

174
00:10:39,550 --> 00:10:40,220
This is

175
00:10:41,030 --> 00:10:41,770
a formation?

176
00:10:42,150 --> 00:10:44,130
I broke all formations on this island.

177
00:10:44,550 --> 00:10:45,980
He must be using real power.

178
00:10:46,630 --> 00:10:47,530
How is that possible?

179
00:10:48,480 --> 00:10:50,250
Maybe he set this formation.

180
00:10:51,150 --> 00:10:52,060
What are we hiding, Hua?

181
00:10:52,080 --> 00:10:52,460
Shh.

182
00:10:52,480 --> 00:10:53,130
Stay quiet.

183
00:10:53,150 --> 00:10:53,980
Be good.

184
00:11:21,270 --> 00:11:21,700
Xiong Er.

185
00:11:21,720 --> 00:11:22,770
Where are you going?

186
00:11:23,150 --> 00:11:25,010
Father, we must save them.

187
00:11:25,030 --> 00:11:25,730
Yeah.

188
00:11:25,790 --> 00:11:26,700
Save them?

189
00:11:28,720 --> 00:11:29,700
It's useless.

190
00:11:31,240 --> 00:11:33,130
You can't save anyone.

191
00:11:34,320 --> 00:11:35,250
Save them, Hua.

192
00:11:36,510 --> 00:11:37,250
Did you see?

193
00:11:37,270 --> 00:11:38,130
This is a test.

194
00:11:38,150 --> 00:11:38,940
A test.

195
00:11:39,120 --> 00:11:39,610
What test?

196
00:11:41,390 --> 00:11:42,220
Grandlord.

197
00:11:42,480 --> 00:11:43,700
Save us.

198
00:11:45,200 --> 00:11:45,850
Grandlord.

199
00:11:45,870 --> 00:11:46,850
The Sea Deity Sect

200
00:11:47,510 --> 00:11:48,530
is nothing special.

201
00:11:48,840 --> 00:11:49,650
Grandlord, save us.

202
00:11:49,670 --> 00:11:51,300
Listen up.

203
00:11:51,320 --> 00:11:53,100
I'm a Westdawn Sect disciple.

204
00:11:53,360 --> 00:11:54,980
Bian Zhuang, Lord of Horizon Hall.

205
00:11:55,150 --> 00:11:56,580
Worshiping the Sea Deity

206
00:11:56,840 --> 00:11:58,300
breaks the Westdawn rules.

207
00:11:58,720 --> 00:12:00,300
Ever thought of the consequences?

208
00:12:02,440 --> 00:12:03,250
Great Deity.

209
00:12:03,750 --> 00:12:05,100
It's all our fault.

210
00:12:05,120 --> 00:12:07,250
Enough, please!

211
00:12:08,000 --> 00:12:08,940
Call it off!

212
00:12:09,440 --> 00:12:10,010
Call it off!

213
00:12:10,030 --> 00:12:11,340
We messed up.

214
00:12:12,550 --> 00:12:14,510
- Please show mercy.
- Mortals

215
00:12:15,240 --> 00:12:16,300
are mere insects.

216
00:12:16,630 --> 00:12:18,730
Cut us some slack.

217
00:12:18,960 --> 00:12:19,730
So,

218
00:12:20,440 --> 00:12:22,730
who spoke those forbidden words

219
00:12:22,840 --> 00:12:24,130
and summoned the Sea Demon?

220
00:12:24,270 --> 00:12:25,060
Him.

221
00:12:25,550 --> 00:12:26,700
Why tell him?

222
00:12:26,720 --> 00:12:27,980
He asked me.

223
00:12:30,480 --> 00:12:31,340
Outsiders,

224
00:12:32,240 --> 00:12:34,980
didn't you say
you'd defeat the Sea Demon?

225
00:12:35,000 --> 00:12:37,530
Sea Deity Sect brings power, you said?

226
00:12:46,320 --> 00:12:47,530
Then let's give it a try.

227
00:12:57,550 --> 00:12:58,490
Run.

228
00:12:59,960 --> 00:13:00,610
Run.

229
00:13:00,790 --> 00:13:01,530
Run.

230
00:13:02,550 --> 00:13:03,650
Good thing I talk fast.

231
00:13:05,960 --> 00:13:06,890
Little brat!

232
00:13:37,220 --> 00:13:41,580
♪See mortal joys and sorrows♪

233
00:13:43,590 --> 00:13:50,080
♪Reunions and partings, as fate unfolds♪

234
00:13:54,670 --> 00:13:55,530
Trust me.

235
00:13:55,750 --> 00:13:58,130
I won't let go of your hand.

236
00:13:58,360 --> 00:14:05,290
♪Memories filled with sorrow♪

237
00:14:05,800 --> 00:14:13,020
♪Slowly, wishes turn to regret♪

238
00:14:13,020 --> 00:14:19,910
♪You've gone afar, like mist fading♪

239
00:14:20,330 --> 00:14:23,230
♪Tears fall♪

240
00:14:24,270 --> 00:14:25,820
Hua, why are we going this way?

241
00:14:25,840 --> 00:14:26,940
Aren't the villain behind us?

242
00:14:26,960 --> 00:14:28,250
I know the villain is there.

243
00:14:28,270 --> 00:14:29,700
That's why we ran this way.

244
00:14:29,960 --> 00:14:30,730
Hua, you...

245
00:14:31,240 --> 00:14:32,530
Are you trying to flee?

246
00:14:32,630 --> 00:14:33,940
Who do you think I am?

247
00:14:37,550 --> 00:14:38,340
Hi, Everyone.

248
00:14:46,750 --> 00:14:48,100
Long time no see.

249
00:14:49,240 --> 00:14:50,010
Hua Ritian.

250
00:14:51,550 --> 00:14:54,300
Spreading rumors
and angering Great Deity,

251
00:14:54,320 --> 00:14:56,010
you're a sinner here.

252
00:14:56,030 --> 00:14:57,130
Have you anything to say?

253
00:15:08,720 --> 00:15:10,610
Bear Island is so great.

254
00:15:10,670 --> 00:15:12,490
We love Bear Island.

255
00:15:12,510 --> 00:15:14,370
Listen to the deity.

256
00:15:14,390 --> 00:15:16,300
And we'll live forever.

257
00:15:21,200 --> 00:15:22,010
Tie him up.

258
00:15:23,000 --> 00:15:26,100
Bear Island is so great.

259
00:15:26,550 --> 00:15:29,890
We love Bear Island.

260
00:15:31,320 --> 00:15:34,820
Listen to the deity.

261
00:15:35,720 --> 00:15:39,180
And we'll live forever.

262
00:15:42,200 --> 00:15:45,340
Help me, please!

263
00:15:56,550 --> 00:15:58,370
This must all be in his plan.

264
00:15:59,600 --> 00:16:02,100
He must've planned his escape.

265
00:16:03,150 --> 00:16:04,820
Making me think he died,

266
00:16:05,750 --> 00:16:06,850
watching me mourn,

267
00:16:07,630 --> 00:16:08,940
then suddenly appearing

268
00:16:09,510 --> 00:16:10,940
to mock and tease me.

269
00:16:13,030 --> 00:16:14,650
I'll wait for him right here.

270
00:16:15,390 --> 00:16:17,010
When he returns, I'll tell him:

271
00:16:17,600 --> 00:16:18,420
You brat.

272
00:16:18,870 --> 00:16:20,610
I guessed your every step.

273
00:16:21,670 --> 00:16:22,730
I know you're not dead.

274
00:16:23,870 --> 00:16:25,130
You won't fool me.

275
00:16:43,790 --> 00:16:44,580
Qing Luan.

276
00:16:45,320 --> 00:16:47,890
I'm Westdawn's Inquisitor Captain now.

277
00:16:47,910 --> 00:16:49,130
I came to take you in.

278
00:16:49,320 --> 00:16:51,060
Come repent by the altar.

279
00:16:51,270 --> 00:16:52,060
I'm not leaving.

280
00:16:53,720 --> 00:16:54,490
Why not?

281
00:16:55,000 --> 00:16:56,100
I'm waiting for him.

282
00:16:58,320 --> 00:16:59,490
You mean Bai Shi?

283
00:17:00,270 --> 00:17:02,060
He was eaten by the Sea Demon.

284
00:17:02,080 --> 00:17:03,300
He's not coming back.

285
00:17:05,640 --> 00:17:06,660
You don't know him.

286
00:17:07,400 --> 00:17:08,220
Stop waiting for him.

287
00:17:08,240 --> 00:17:09,290
Come with me.

288
00:17:09,640 --> 00:17:12,010
That brat always plays mysterious,

289
00:17:12,030 --> 00:17:12,900
full of wicked ideas,

290
00:17:12,920 --> 00:17:14,330
not likable at all.

291
00:17:15,240 --> 00:17:16,330
But one thing

292
00:17:16,350 --> 00:17:17,530
I know for sure.

293
00:17:17,720 --> 00:17:19,010
Without absolute certainty,

294
00:17:19,590 --> 00:17:20,810
he'd never do it.

295
00:17:22,440 --> 00:17:24,090
I'm talking to you.

296
00:17:27,000 --> 00:17:28,620
Do we catch her or not?

297
00:17:28,640 --> 00:17:29,490
Your call.

298
00:17:46,070 --> 00:17:46,900
Why not

299
00:17:47,830 --> 00:17:48,810
leave this place to me?

300
00:17:49,200 --> 00:17:49,980
Let's go.

301
00:18:04,510 --> 00:18:05,730
Mortals are like this.

302
00:18:06,510 --> 00:18:07,700
They have no power,

303
00:18:08,400 --> 00:18:09,810
relying on immortals for everything.

304
00:18:11,110 --> 00:18:11,980
Whichever immortal works,

305
00:18:12,000 --> 00:18:13,460
that's who they believe in.

306
00:18:13,790 --> 00:18:15,050
Fairy, with your grand vision,

307
00:18:15,510 --> 00:18:16,730
you naturally despise them.

308
00:18:18,510 --> 00:18:19,490
What Fairy?

309
00:18:19,590 --> 00:18:20,620
- I am...
- Fairy Yunxiao.

310
00:18:23,070 --> 00:18:24,010
You know me?

311
00:18:25,640 --> 00:18:26,940
I recognized you from the start.

312
00:18:28,680 --> 00:18:29,490
What do you want?

313
00:18:35,720 --> 00:18:37,660
I gladly offer my assistance.

314
00:18:38,310 --> 00:18:38,900
You

315
00:18:39,440 --> 00:18:40,620
want to help me?

316
00:18:42,790 --> 00:18:43,810
Fairy, are you

317
00:18:45,510 --> 00:18:46,490
looking for the Pregenesis Sword?

318
00:18:50,440 --> 00:18:51,290
It's fine.

319
00:18:52,270 --> 00:18:53,700
I just want to make

320
00:18:54,160 --> 00:18:55,050
friends with you.

321
00:18:56,790 --> 00:18:57,570
Make friends?

322
00:18:58,680 --> 00:18:59,940
Just with words?

323
00:19:02,920 --> 00:19:03,770
The Pregenesis Sword

324
00:19:04,310 --> 00:19:05,660
is an ancient divine weapon.

325
00:19:05,880 --> 00:19:07,980
The Demon Emperor
dominated the three realms with it.

326
00:19:08,000 --> 00:19:09,050
How thrilling.

327
00:19:09,680 --> 00:19:11,530
Pity my cultivation was shallow then,

328
00:19:12,030 --> 00:19:13,330
unable to witness the battle

329
00:19:13,680 --> 00:19:15,090
or behold its glory.

330
00:19:15,680 --> 00:19:16,900
I'm preaching on Bear Island

331
00:19:17,480 --> 00:19:18,900
just to find that sword.

332
00:19:19,920 --> 00:19:21,940
Just one glance at the treasure,

333
00:19:23,680 --> 00:19:25,050
and I'd be satisfied.

334
00:19:25,440 --> 00:19:28,140
You know it's hidden on the island,

335
00:19:28,880 --> 00:19:30,330
but don't know what it looks like?

336
00:19:31,680 --> 00:19:34,090
So I made the villagers dig

337
00:19:34,110 --> 00:19:35,660
and tribute the rocks to me.

338
00:19:36,200 --> 00:19:37,900
As long as the sword is here,

339
00:19:37,920 --> 00:19:39,660
I'll find it sooner or later.

340
00:19:40,400 --> 00:19:41,730
How long

341
00:19:42,310 --> 00:19:43,460
have they been digging?

342
00:19:45,510 --> 00:19:46,490
A few centuries.

343
00:19:46,590 --> 00:19:47,490
Found anything?

344
00:19:51,110 --> 00:19:52,140
Just rocks.

345
00:19:56,110 --> 00:19:57,730
My Horizon Hall's almost stuffed full.

346
00:19:59,880 --> 00:20:00,700
So

347
00:20:01,310 --> 00:20:02,810
you can't find it either.

348
00:20:03,030 --> 00:20:04,140
What use are you to me?

349
00:20:04,790 --> 00:20:05,700
I'm an outsider,

350
00:20:06,680 --> 00:20:07,530
but you're different.

351
00:20:07,920 --> 00:20:09,180
Living on Bear Island so long,

352
00:20:09,200 --> 00:20:10,460
they've accepted you.

353
00:20:10,830 --> 00:20:11,620
So you can find out things

354
00:20:11,640 --> 00:20:12,900
I never could.

355
00:20:16,000 --> 00:20:16,490
Fairy,

356
00:20:17,070 --> 00:20:18,090
we should team up.

357
00:20:18,200 --> 00:20:19,490
I handle things outside, you inside.

358
00:20:20,070 --> 00:20:21,420
Once we find the sword,

359
00:20:21,510 --> 00:20:22,860
I'll hand it over to you.

360
00:20:23,510 --> 00:20:24,290
What do you say?

361
00:20:31,440 --> 00:20:32,290
I'm waiting for someone.

362
00:20:32,640 --> 00:20:33,810
Please don't disturb me.

363
00:20:41,310 --> 00:20:43,530
Such a pity.

364
00:20:44,880 --> 00:20:46,090
One step too late after all.

365
00:20:46,110 --> 00:20:47,460
Someone beat me to it.

366
00:20:49,510 --> 00:20:51,290
But the person you wait for,

367
00:20:53,200 --> 00:20:54,460
wouldn't he lie to you?

368
00:20:56,110 --> 00:20:56,570
Yunxiao.

369
00:20:57,030 --> 00:20:58,570
No matter how the plan unfolds,

370
00:20:58,590 --> 00:21:00,250
I hope you will remember one thing.

371
00:21:00,440 --> 00:21:02,900
Whether it's deception or concealment,

372
00:21:03,680 --> 00:21:04,420
sometimes,

373
00:21:05,240 --> 00:21:06,490
it's not always out of malice.

374
00:21:07,510 --> 00:21:09,730
Was he devoured by the Sea Demon?

375
00:21:09,920 --> 00:21:11,250
Or did he seize the chance to flee,

376
00:21:11,920 --> 00:21:13,700
leaving you alone on this island?

377
00:21:16,510 --> 00:21:18,250
Like I don't wanna leave?

378
00:21:18,590 --> 00:21:20,090
I just can't.

379
00:21:26,480 --> 00:21:28,010
If you find anything,

380
00:21:28,110 --> 00:21:29,140
please inform me.

381
00:21:29,480 --> 00:21:30,460
The Horizon Hall

382
00:21:30,830 --> 00:21:31,860
will surely

383
00:21:31,880 --> 00:21:33,090
find the Pregenesis Sword for you.

384
00:21:44,480 --> 00:21:45,250
So,

385
00:21:46,680 --> 00:21:47,810
did you lie to me?

386
00:21:49,070 --> 00:21:50,220
Little brat.

387
00:22:13,550 --> 00:22:15,460
So that's why.

388
00:22:16,480 --> 00:22:18,940
No wonder I couldn't reach your dreams.

389
00:22:20,750 --> 00:22:23,180
Fairy Yunxiao's trapped on Bear Island,

390
00:22:23,240 --> 00:22:24,860
her magical power won't work.

391
00:22:25,030 --> 00:22:26,380
That is her punishment.

392
00:22:26,400 --> 00:22:27,140
Very good.

393
00:22:28,070 --> 00:22:29,180
I also found out

394
00:22:29,480 --> 00:22:31,330
the Westdawn Sect

395
00:22:31,440 --> 00:22:32,700
is eyeing the Pregenesis Sword too.

396
00:22:32,720 --> 00:22:33,980
The Celestial Court must keep watch.

397
00:22:34,590 --> 00:22:35,380
Westdawn Sect?

398
00:22:38,510 --> 00:22:39,860
They have always

399
00:22:40,270 --> 00:22:42,050
kept clear of disputes

400
00:22:42,070 --> 00:22:43,980
and never meddled in the Three Sects.

401
00:22:44,070 --> 00:22:44,770
Why so keen

402
00:22:44,790 --> 00:22:47,090
on the Pregenesis Sword?

403
00:22:48,440 --> 00:22:49,220
Duke.

404
00:22:49,790 --> 00:22:50,860
I want to know

405
00:22:51,200 --> 00:22:52,860
what the Pregenesis Sword really is,

406
00:22:53,110 --> 00:22:56,570
and why Bear Island strips all power.

407
00:22:56,750 --> 00:22:57,490
Really wanna know?

408
00:22:59,110 --> 00:22:59,810
Beg me.

409
00:23:00,680 --> 00:23:01,420
Your disciple, Li Changshou...

410
00:23:01,440 --> 00:23:02,090
Get up, get up.

411
00:23:02,110 --> 00:23:02,860
Just testing you.

412
00:23:02,880 --> 00:23:03,700
Fine.

413
00:23:04,110 --> 00:23:05,860
Since you've been to Bear Island,

414
00:23:05,920 --> 00:23:07,420
I won't hide it from you.

415
00:23:07,790 --> 00:23:09,460
The Pregenesis Sword

416
00:23:09,790 --> 00:23:15,290
is forged by the Ancestral Witch heirs.

417
00:23:16,070 --> 00:23:17,330
Ancestral Witch heirs?

418
00:23:20,070 --> 00:23:21,620
Know who they are?

419
00:23:22,240 --> 00:23:23,050
Let me tell you.

420
00:23:25,590 --> 00:23:27,220
The Ancestral Witch heirs

421
00:23:27,480 --> 00:23:29,570
are tall and burly.

422
00:23:29,590 --> 00:23:31,860
Super physically strong.

423
00:23:32,030 --> 00:23:33,570
Why didn't they cultivate?

424
00:23:33,750 --> 00:23:35,730
That's because they think they can

425
00:23:35,750 --> 00:23:37,460
overwhelm any other clan.

426
00:23:38,720 --> 00:23:40,860
They even built a monument.

427
00:23:41,350 --> 00:23:43,010
Guess what's written on that?

428
00:23:44,550 --> 00:23:46,330
It says,

429
00:23:46,960 --> 00:23:51,050
"There is no deity in this world."

430
00:23:51,510 --> 00:23:53,570
"Because we are deities."

431
00:23:53,830 --> 00:23:54,860
Right?

432
00:23:54,880 --> 00:23:56,940
So arrogant.

433
00:23:56,960 --> 00:23:57,660
Yes.

434
00:23:57,750 --> 00:23:58,860
[Because we are deities]
Witnessed it.

435
00:23:59,160 --> 00:24:00,620
Ten thousand years ago,

436
00:24:00,790 --> 00:24:02,980
they forged the Pregenesis Sword

437
00:24:03,000 --> 00:24:06,530
that counters all power,

438
00:24:06,550 --> 00:24:08,730
dreaming of ruling the Three Realms.

439
00:24:10,440 --> 00:24:11,700
Countering all power?

440
00:24:12,550 --> 00:24:13,330
Could it be...

441
00:24:16,440 --> 00:24:17,220
Smart.

442
00:24:17,830 --> 00:24:18,090
You know

443
00:24:18,110 --> 00:24:20,050
why you lost all power on Bear Island?

444
00:24:20,160 --> 00:24:21,180
Because the Pregenesis Sword

445
00:24:21,200 --> 00:24:23,250
is stuck somewhere on Bear Island.

446
00:24:23,480 --> 00:24:25,460
Ever heard of the Deity-Demon War?

447
00:24:25,880 --> 00:24:26,570
Yes.

448
00:24:26,590 --> 00:24:29,420
Three Sects' victory over Demon Clan.

449
00:24:30,960 --> 00:24:33,460
The weapon used by the Demon Emperor

450
00:24:33,480 --> 00:24:35,090
was the Pregenesis Sword.

451
00:24:35,160 --> 00:24:37,010
After it was forged,

452
00:24:37,160 --> 00:24:38,620
demons emerged.

453
00:24:38,750 --> 00:24:39,570
Pity though,

454
00:24:40,110 --> 00:24:41,180
that sword

455
00:24:41,200 --> 00:24:42,730
counters all power,

456
00:24:42,750 --> 00:24:44,660
but not Demonic Arts.

457
00:24:44,680 --> 00:24:47,250
Almost wiped out the Human Clan.

458
00:24:47,480 --> 00:24:48,860
Doesn't counter Demonic Arts?

459
00:24:50,070 --> 00:24:52,140
So that man was using Demonic Arts.

460
00:24:52,160 --> 00:24:53,900
A thousand years ago,

461
00:24:54,030 --> 00:24:57,050
the Grand Mage of Voidcity
defeated the Demon Emperor,

462
00:24:57,240 --> 00:24:59,860
and sealed the Pregenesis Sword
on Bear Island,

463
00:25:01,680 --> 00:25:05,090
entrusting it to the remaining
Ancestral Witch heirs to guard.

464
00:25:07,270 --> 00:25:08,290
Seems the people there

465
00:25:08,310 --> 00:25:10,660
forgot they're Ancestral Witch heirs.

466
00:25:11,270 --> 00:25:13,250
Westdawn Sect fears them remembering,

467
00:25:13,310 --> 00:25:14,940
so they hid the monument inscription.

468
00:25:15,720 --> 00:25:17,010
Although the Grand Mage

469
00:25:17,030 --> 00:25:19,180
sealed the sword on Bear Island,

470
00:25:19,680 --> 00:25:22,490
he worried Ancestral Witch heirs

471
00:25:22,640 --> 00:25:24,770
might use it to cause trouble again.

472
00:25:26,240 --> 00:25:27,250
The Grand Mage declared,

473
00:25:28,070 --> 00:25:32,250
if they use the sword to revolt,

474
00:25:33,270 --> 00:25:36,860
the whole clan will be wiped out.

475
00:25:38,240 --> 00:25:41,490
The whole clan will be wiped out.

476
00:25:43,960 --> 00:25:44,730
Alright. That's it.

477
00:25:45,270 --> 00:25:46,050
Tell you what,

478
00:25:46,070 --> 00:25:48,050
about the Westdawn matter you mentioned,

479
00:25:48,070 --> 00:25:50,050
I'll send someone to investigate.

480
00:25:50,070 --> 00:25:52,530
Too busy. Talk to you later.

481
00:25:53,590 --> 00:25:55,700
Duke. Duke.

482
00:25:56,110 --> 00:25:57,620
We agreed, making up for my mistake,

483
00:25:57,640 --> 00:25:58,290
and my post in the Celestial Court...

484
00:25:58,310 --> 00:26:00,660
What are you talking about?

485
00:26:00,680 --> 00:26:02,570
Did you capture Fairy Yunxiao?

486
00:26:02,590 --> 00:26:04,490
She's trapped on Bear Island by me.

487
00:26:04,510 --> 00:26:05,660
What if she escapes?

488
00:26:05,680 --> 00:26:06,490
Around Bear Island,

489
00:26:06,510 --> 00:26:07,660
I already set heavy formations.

490
00:26:07,790 --> 00:26:09,330
Also another group of sword thieves...

491
00:26:09,400 --> 00:26:10,250
Bian Zhuang, Lord of Horizon Hall.

492
00:26:10,270 --> 00:26:10,900
He's just a big butterfly.

493
00:26:10,920 --> 00:26:11,770
He has two disciples. Laodao

494
00:26:11,790 --> 00:26:12,460
and Wang Cai.

495
00:26:12,480 --> 00:26:13,860
Horizon Hall lies by the South Sea.

496
00:26:13,880 --> 00:26:15,250
Here's the map.

497
00:26:18,020 --> 00:26:19,020
[Horizon Hall, Bear Island]

498
00:26:24,000 --> 00:26:26,620
You've got it all figured out.

499
00:26:26,640 --> 00:26:28,570
Leave some for me.

500
00:26:29,270 --> 00:26:30,810
I also found out

501
00:26:31,510 --> 00:26:33,810
the Celestial Court turned a blind eye

502
00:26:33,830 --> 00:26:36,220
while Westdawn runs riot
in the South Sea.

503
00:26:36,240 --> 00:26:38,490
That's dereliction of duty.

504
00:26:39,350 --> 00:26:40,860
What's that supposed to mean?

505
00:26:41,200 --> 00:26:44,180
If I report this
to the Celestial Emperor,

506
00:26:44,200 --> 00:26:47,050
won't it be tough for you?

507
00:26:49,240 --> 00:26:50,010
Go report it.

508
00:26:50,640 --> 00:26:51,460
Go ahead. Report me.

509
00:26:52,160 --> 00:26:53,810
If you can bring His Majesty back,

510
00:26:53,830 --> 00:26:55,250
I'll give you that.

511
00:26:55,350 --> 00:26:56,290
I wanted to quit long ago.

512
00:26:56,310 --> 00:26:57,490
What kind of trash place is this?

513
00:26:57,590 --> 00:26:58,530
Such a huge Celestial Court,

514
00:26:58,550 --> 00:26:59,620
every petty drama comes to me.

515
00:26:59,640 --> 00:27:00,570
Every mess lands on me.

516
00:27:00,590 --> 00:27:03,460
Can I handle all that?

517
00:27:05,590 --> 00:27:06,900
His Majesty is absent?

518
00:27:08,000 --> 00:27:08,980
Of course he is.

519
00:27:09,270 --> 00:27:11,810
Ditching his job as Emperor,

520
00:27:11,880 --> 00:27:12,980
yelling and screaming all day,

521
00:27:13,000 --> 00:27:15,050
playing artist here and there.

522
00:27:15,110 --> 00:27:15,700
Fine.

523
00:27:15,720 --> 00:27:17,050
He ran off happy,

524
00:27:17,070 --> 00:27:18,460
- and I suffer.
- Artist?

525
00:27:18,480 --> 00:27:19,860
Come back quickly.

526
00:27:20,070 --> 00:27:22,530
A little spider, all legs right through.

527
00:27:22,640 --> 00:27:25,250
Mortal humans are nothing but jaw.

528
00:27:25,510 --> 00:27:26,460
To be honest,

529
00:27:28,720 --> 00:27:30,220
I am an artist.

530
00:27:30,240 --> 00:27:32,380
You did this to me.

531
00:27:32,400 --> 00:27:33,810
Clap if you're with me.

532
00:27:35,510 --> 00:27:36,290
Where?

533
00:27:42,790 --> 00:27:43,570
Even the spirit stones

534
00:27:43,590 --> 00:27:46,330
can't find His Majesty.

535
00:27:54,350 --> 00:27:55,940
Wanna stay in the Celestial Court?

536
00:27:59,070 --> 00:28:01,290
Alright. Help me with one thing.

537
00:28:01,310 --> 00:28:03,250
Find the Celestial Emperor

538
00:28:03,270 --> 00:28:04,490
and bring him back.

539
00:28:04,510 --> 00:28:06,570
I'll grant your wish.

540
00:28:08,350 --> 00:28:09,140
Well, Duke.

541
00:28:10,590 --> 00:28:13,570
If... I mean, what if

542
00:28:15,270 --> 00:28:17,900
someone hurt that person?

543
00:28:17,920 --> 00:28:19,250
What would happen?

544
00:28:26,240 --> 00:28:27,460
Better get ready

545
00:28:28,070 --> 00:28:30,140
for reincarnation.

546
00:28:36,270 --> 00:28:37,250
Reincarnation...

547
00:28:39,440 --> 00:28:40,660
Reincarnation...

548
00:28:42,830 --> 00:28:45,220
Reincarnation!

549
00:28:45,240 --> 00:28:48,250
Reincarnation!

550
00:28:48,790 --> 00:28:51,010
Listen to the deity.

551
00:28:51,030 --> 00:28:53,140
And we'll live forever.

552
00:28:53,160 --> 00:28:55,490
Bear Island is so great.

553
00:28:55,510 --> 00:28:57,810
We love Bear Island.

554
00:28:57,830 --> 00:28:59,900
Listen to the deity.

555
00:28:59,920 --> 00:29:02,140
And we'll live forever.

556
00:29:02,160 --> 00:29:03,010
Bear Island is so great.

557
00:29:03,030 --> 00:29:04,570
Move those hands, all of you.

558
00:29:04,590 --> 00:29:05,810
No slacking.

559
00:29:05,830 --> 00:29:07,570
On Bear Island,
only beasts work till they drop.

560
00:29:07,590 --> 00:29:09,140
No fallow field is ruined by tilling.

561
00:29:09,160 --> 00:29:11,050
And we'll live forever.

562
00:29:12,830 --> 00:29:13,730
Liars.

563
00:29:14,440 --> 00:29:15,570
All liars.

564
00:29:15,880 --> 00:29:17,050
Let's burn him.

565
00:29:17,070 --> 00:29:23,180
Burn him. Burn him.

566
00:29:23,720 --> 00:29:24,180
Wake up.

567
00:29:24,200 --> 00:29:24,770
Who is it?

568
00:29:25,200 --> 00:29:26,220
Hua, it's me.

569
00:29:26,550 --> 00:29:27,570
I'm here to save you.

570
00:29:27,590 --> 00:29:28,380
Ke Le'er.

571
00:29:29,000 --> 00:29:33,180
Abandoned by all, yet you never left.

572
00:29:33,270 --> 00:29:34,090
Keep it down.

573
00:29:34,480 --> 00:29:35,460
I'll get you down first.

574
00:29:45,550 --> 00:29:47,490
You think

575
00:29:48,070 --> 00:29:50,330
I couldn't see through the cheap tricks?

576
00:30:09,070 --> 00:30:12,860
Cut the Red Thread. Sever the bond.

577
00:30:15,680 --> 00:30:16,460
Drama...

578
00:30:16,680 --> 00:30:17,660
Romance again.

579
00:30:19,350 --> 00:30:20,530
Why is it a Golden Thread?

580
